    "body": "Ah, this then means that the Vue serializer used for Jest outputs the DOM differently then the other ones. To \"fix\" this, we smooth out differences like this in the normalize function that should be at the top of the file, by usually adding a regular expression that targets the relevant extra whitespace and removes it.",
